---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { getCollection } from "astro:content";
const guides = (await getCollection("blog")).filter((post) => !post.data.draft && post.data.category === "Invest").sort((a, b) => b.data.pubDate.getTime() - a.data.pubDate.getTime()).slice(0, 4);
---
<BaseLayout title="Ontario Real Estate Investing | Dongho Lee" description="Practical Ontario real estate investment guidance for clearer long-term decisions.">
  <section class="services-hero"><p class="page-kicker">Invest in Real Estate</p><h1>Invest with a Clear Plan</h1><p class="lead">Whether you are considering your first investment property, building long-term income or planning for retirement, we connect the numbers to your goals. Cash flow, risk, location and holding strategy are reviewed together before you make a move.</p><p class="lead ko">첫 투자 주택, 장기 임대 수입, 은퇴 계획까지 투자 결정을 목표와 숫자에 연결해 함께 살펴봅니다. 현금흐름, 리스크, 지역과 보유 전략을 한 가지 계획으로 정리합니다.</p><div class="hero-actions journey-hero-actions"><a class="button primary" href="/contact/?source=invest_consultation">무료 투자 상담 신청하기</a><a class="button secondary" href="tel:14166258241">Call · 전화 416-625-8241</a></div></section>
  <section class="conversion-panel" aria-label="How Dongho helps real estate investors"><div class="conversion-copy"><p class="page-kicker">Start Here</p><h2>An investment decision is more than a promising listing.</h2><p>We begin with your objectives, budget, financing and preferred timeline. Then we compare opportunities with a practical view of income, expenses, demand, risk and the work required to hold the property well.</p></div><div class="conversion-actions"><a class="button primary" href="/contact/?source=invest_consultation">무료 투자 상담 신청하기</a><span>한국어 · English 상담 가능</span></div></section>
  <section class="services-grid journey-steps" aria-label="Investment support">
    <article class="service-card"><div class="service-icon">01</div><h2>Plan <span>목표 설정</span></h2><h3>Objectives, budget and timeline</h3><p>투자 기간, 예산, 자금 조달과 리스크 허용 범위를 정리해 기준부터 분명하게 만듭니다.</p></article>
    <article class="service-card"><div class="service-icon">02</div><h2>Search <span>기회 탐색</span></h2><h3>Location, property type and demand</h3><p>지역, 주택 유형, 임대 수요와 장기 보유 가능성을 비교해 목표에 맞는 선택지를 좁힙니다.</p></article>
    <article class="service-card"><div class="service-icon">03</div><h2>Analyze <span>수익 분석</span></h2><h3>Income, expenses and risk</h3><p>예상 임대 수입, 운영비, 공실 가능성, 유지 비용과 현금흐름을 현실적인 가정으로 검토합니다.</p></article>
    <article class="service-card"><div class="service-icon">04</div><h2>Execute <span>투자 실행</span></h2><h3>Offer, closing and holding strategy</h3><p>오퍼와 협상, 조건, 클로징부터 보유 중 필요한 의사결정까지 다음 단계를 함께 준비합니다.</p></article>
  </section>
  <section class="featured-guides" aria-label="Investment guides"><div class="home-section-heading"><div><p class="page-kicker">Related Guides</p><h2>Investment and Long-term Planning</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/category/invest/">모든 투자 가이드 보기</a></div><div class="home-posts">{guides.map((post) => <article class="post-card"><h2><a href={`/${post.slug}/`}>{post.data.title}</a></h2><p>{post.data.description}</p></article>)}</div></section>
  <section class="services-cta"><div><p class="page-kicker">Next Step</p><h2>Build a practical investment plan.<small>현실적인 투자 계획을 함께 세워보세요.</small></h2><p>Tell us your goals, budget and timeline. We will help you identify the most useful next step.</p><p class="ko-copy">투자 목표, 예산과 예상 시점을 알려주시면 지금 비교해야 할 선택지와 다음 단계를 함께 정리해 드립니다.</p><a class="button primary" href="/contact/?source=invest_consultation">투자 상담 시작하기</a></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
